==Description==
'''Ruthie''' was a narrator that appeared in [[Backyard Beginnings]], [[Competition Court]] and [[Victory Field]] maps.

==Appearance==
'''Ruthie''' has pale skin and blond hair. She wears white socks, grey shoes and a white, blue and red shirt with "''World Cup USA 94''" written on it.

